:"归经：归胃、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830162530-mfe0xdj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830162530-mfe0xdj","updated":"20240830162637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功效：杀虫，下乳，利水消肿（通利小便，消除水肿）的功效。"}]},{"ID":"20240830162536-kyg8vvt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830162536-kyg8vvt","updated":"20240830162551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制方法：南瓜成熟后，取出种子去除果肉，晾干或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830162503-tsnzuhz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830162503-tsnzuhz"}},{"ID":"20240830162503-e7vmmny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830162503-e7vmmny"}}]}